mage": "/430/430_ms4583_1_71_012_thumb.jpg", "page": "12", "label": "12", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-and-edward-partridge-20-march-1839/12"}, {"image": "/430/430_ms4583_1_71_013_thumb.jpg", "page": "13", "label": "13", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-and-edward-partridge-20-march-1839/13"}, {"image": "/430/430_ms4583_1_71_014_thumb.jpg", "page": "14", "label": "14", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-and-edward-partridge-20-march-1839/14"}, {"image": "/430/430_ms4583_1_71_015_thumb.jpg", "page": "15", "label": "15", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-and-edward-partridge-20-march-1839/15"}, {"image": "/430/430_ms4583_1_71_016_thumb.jpg", "page": "16", "label": "16", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-and-edward-partridge-20-march-1839/16"}, {"image": "/430/430_ms4583_1_71_017_thumb.jpg", "page": "17", "label": "17", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-and-edward-partridge-20-march-1839/17"}, {"image": "/430/430_ms4583_1_71_017-01_thumb.jpg", "page": "18", "label": "[18]", "href": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-and-edward-partridge-20-march-1839/18"}], "tableOfContents": [], "summary": {"uri": "letter-to-the-church-and-edward-partridge-20-march-1839", "series": "JSPPD", "urlTitleValue": "JSPPD6", "documentSeriesTitle": "Letter to the Church and Edward Partridge, 20 March 1839", "editorialPageNumber": "8", "isPageNumberPresent": true, "searchUrl": "/published/jsp/searchable/papers/21225849/21225849-0008.xml", "clearText": "<html><head></head><body><div class=\"indent continuation wasptag\">managements lie slain victoms at the feet of hope and when the hart is sufficiently contrite then the voice of inspiration steals along and whispers my son pease be unto thy soul thine advirsity and thy afflictions shall be but a small moment<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"13490917738175444263\"><a href=\"#13490917738175444263\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans38\"><span id=\"documenttrans38\">38</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Isaiah 54:7.</p><hr></div></div></aside> and then if thou indure it well God shall exalt thee on high thou shalt tryumph over all they foes thy friends do stand by thee and they shall hail thee again with warm harts and friendly hands thou art not yet as Job thy friends do not contend against thee neither charge thee with transgretion as they did Job<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"7444205596562332292\"><a href=\"#7444205596562332292\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans39\"><span id=\"documenttrans39\">39</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Job chaps. 4–5, 8, 11, 15, 18, 20, 22, 25, 32–37.</p><hr></div></div></aside> and they who do charge thee with transgretion<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"7026503615736278206\"><a href=\"#7026503615736278206\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans40\"><span id=\"documenttrans40\">40</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">This section likely refers to <a href=\"/topic/church-of-christ\" class=\"referenceInPop\">Latter-day Saints</a> who dissented from the church in 1838 and opposed JS. (See <a href=\"/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-in-caldwell-county-missouri-16-december-1838\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/letter-to-the-church-in-caldwell-county-missouri-16-december-1838\" poptitle=\"Letter to the Church in Caldwell County, Missouri, 16 December 1838\">Letter to the Church in Caldwell Co., MO, 16 Dec. 1838</a>.)</p><hr></div></div></aside> there hope shall be blasted and there prospects shall melt away as the hory frost melteth before the burning rays of the rising sun and also that God hath set to his hand and seal to change the times and seasons<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"9815314670813344375\"><a href=\"#9815314670813344375\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans41\"><span id=\"documenttrans41\">41</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Daniel 2:21.</p><hr></div></div></aside> and to blind their minds that they may not understand his marvilos workings<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"11390521604827745494\"><a href=\"#11390521604827745494\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans42\"><span id=\"documenttrans42\">42</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See 2 Corinthians 4:4.</p><hr></div></div></aside> that he may prove them also and take them in there own craftiness<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"8798034898862389182\"><a href=\"#8798034898862389182\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans43\"><span id=\"documenttrans43\">43</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Job 5:13.</p><hr></div></div></aside> also because their harts are corrupt and the thing which they are willing to bring upon others and love to have others suffer may come upon themselvs to the verry utmost that they may be disappointed also and their hopes may be cut off<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"6313372865735431446\"><a href=\"#6313372865735431446\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans44\"><span id=\"documenttrans44\">44</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Job 8:14.</p><hr></div></div></aside> and not many years hence that they and their pasterity shall be swept from under heaven saith God that not one of them [p. 8]</div></body></html>", "expandedText": "<html><head></head><body><div class=\"indent continuation wasptag\">managements lie slain victoms at the feet of hope <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>and when the hart is sufficiently contrite <span class=\"deleted\">and</span> &lt;​then​&gt; the <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>voice of inspiration steals along and whispers my <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>son pease be unto thy soul thine advirsity and thy <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>afflictions shall be but a small moment<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"486494543914798937\"><a href=\"#486494543914798937\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans38\"><span id=\"documenttrans38\">38</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Isaiah 54:7.</p><hr></div></div></aside> and then <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>if thou indure it well God shall exalt<span class=\"deleted\">s</span> the[e] on <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>high thou shalt tryumph over all they foes thy <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>friends do stand by the[e] and they shall hail the[e] again <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>with warm harts and friendly hands thou art <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span><span class=\"deleted\">yet</span> not yet as Job thy friends do not contend again[st] <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>the[e] <span class=\"deleted\">the</span> neither charge the[e] with transgretion as <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>they did Job<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"14257733898190565479\"><a href=\"#14257733898190565479\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans39\"><span id=\"documenttrans39\">39</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Job chaps. 4–5, 8, 11, 15, 18, 20, 22, 25, 32–37.</p><hr></div></div></aside> and they &lt;​who​&gt; do <span class=\"deleted\">the</span> charge the[e] <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>with transgretion<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"2469478594586229590\"><a href=\"#2469478594586229590\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans40\"><span id=\"documenttrans40\">40</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">This section likely refers to <a href=\"/topic/church-of-christ\" class=\"referenceInPop\">Latter-day Saints</a> who dissented from the church in 1838 and opposed JS. (See <a href=\"/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-in-caldwell-county-missouri-16-december-1838\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/letter-to-the-church-in-caldwell-county-missouri-16-december-1838\" poptitle=\"Letter to the Church in Caldwell County, Missouri, 16 December 1838\">Letter to the Church in Caldwell Co., MO, 16 Dec. 1838</a>.)</p><hr></div></div></aside> there hope shall be blasted <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>and there prospects shall melt away as the hory <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>frost melteth before the burning rays of the <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>rising sun and also that God hath set to his <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>hand and seal to change the times and seasons<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"7130219112194427030\"><a href=\"#7130219112194427030\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans41\"><span id=\"documenttrans41\">41</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Daniel 2:21.</p><hr></div></div></aside> <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>and to blind their minds that they may not <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>understand his marvilos workings<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"4526955044577200923\"><a href=\"#4526955044577200923\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans42\"><span id=\"documenttrans42\">42</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See 2 Corinthians 4:4.</p><hr></div></div></aside> that he may <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>prove them also and take them in there own <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>craftiness<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"3307102977571676478\"><a href=\"#3307102977571676478\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans43\"><span id=\"documenttrans43\">43</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Job 5:13.</p><hr></div></div></aside> also because their harts are corrupt <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>and the thing which they are willing to bring upon <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>others and love to have others suffer may come <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>upon them&lt;​selvs​&gt; to the verry utmost that they may be <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>disappointed also and their hopes may be cut <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>off<aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"3922749285046141166\"><a href=\"#3922749285046141166\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans44\"><span id=\"documenttrans44\">44</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Job 8:14.</p><hr></div></div></aside> and not many years hence that they and <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>their pasterity shall be swept from under <span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span>heaven saith God that not one of them [p. 8]</div></body></html>", "calendarsOfDocuments": [], "versions": [{"versionTitle": "Letter to the Church and Edward Partridge, 20 March 1839", "versionLink": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-and-edward-partridge-20-march-1839/1", "versionFeatured": "true"}, {"versionTitle": "Letter to the Church and Edward Partridge, 20 March 1839, as Published in <em xmlns:tei=\"http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0\" xmlns:lds=\"https://ldsc.xmlref.com/local/ldschurch\">Times and Seasons</em>", "versionLink": "/paper-summary/letter-to-the-church-and-edward-partridge-20-march-1839-as-published-in-times-and-seasons/1", "versionFeatured": ""}, {"versionTitle": " History, 1838–1856, volume C-1 [2 November 1838–31 July 1842]", "versionLink": "/paper-summary/history-1838-1856-volume-c-1-2-november-1838-31-july-1842/81", "versionFeatured": ""}, {"versionTitle": "“History of Joseph Smith”", "versionLink": "/paper-summary/history-of-joseph-smith/333", "versionFeatured": ""}], "images": {"smallImageUrl": "/430/430_ms4583_1_71_008_thumb.jpg", "mediumImageUrl": "/430/430_ms4583_1_71_008_med.jpg", "largeImageUrl": "/430/430_ms4583_1_71_008.jpg", "downloadImageUrl": "/430/430_ms4583_1_71_008_download.jpg"}, "imageCredit": "", "facsimile": "", "dzUrlXml": "/430/430_ms4583_1_71_008.xml", "classification": "Documents", "publishedStatus": "FinalConten